  "details": "For fall back shaders, transparency and fade have issues when in fallback mode and they do not look right with double sided enabled. As it is with Unity transparency is rendered back-to-front instead of front-to-back. In order to prevent transparency stacking issues it would be a good idea to have the shaders use a prepass when selecting \"double sided\" for Transparency/Fade presets for Fallback options.",
